    <div class="article-body">

        <p>A shipping profile tells Whatnot your item's packed weight and, in some cases, its dimensions.</p>
        <p>This information helps determine how the item ships, what buyers pay for shipping at checkout, and how orders are bundled.</p>
        <p>Choose the suggested profile that best matches your item's packed weight and shipping needs, or create a custom shipping profile for more control.</p>

